            <STRING>$givervar$</STRING>
          </PROPERTY>
          <PROPERTY TYPE="string_array">
            <NAME>phrase</NAME>
            <STRING>"Yo, $player$! Looking for work? Good. My folk are beachcombers, like Loria's were. We live on what the lake leaves on the shore.{break}In the tale, Loria fills her pocket with white coral pebbles. In the play, our Loria loses half of hers in the sand. Every show!{break}Coral costs dappers. Shell is free, and from the back row nobody can tell the difference. Don't tell $noeh$ I said so.{break}Take this pick. Follow the waterline until you see a source, then extract from it. Go gently, and the source lasts longer.{break}Bring me $shell_qt$ $shell.p$, the whitest you can find." OFFER</STRING>
          </PROPERTY>
          <PROPERTY TYPE="string_array">
            <NAME>phrase_yes</NAME>
            <STRING>"I'll fill my pockets." ACCEPT</STRING>
          </PROPERTY>
