          </PROPERTY>
          <PROPERTY TYPE="string_array">
            <NAME>phrase</NAME>
            <STRING>"Careful, that's pinned! Oh. A new pair of hands. Good, I can use those.{break}Everybody knows Loria never did her chores in the lodging. Nobody ever asks who did them for her.{break}Our Loria hops over stepping stones every show, and her boots are through at the toes again.{break}So today the chore is yours. Here is the pattern for a pair of light boots, the tool, and the makings.{break}Open your crafting actions, choose the boots, and place each material where the pattern asks. One pair will do." OFFER</STRING>
          </PROPERTY>
          <PROPERTY TYPE="string_array">
            <NAME>phrase_yes</NAME>
            <STRING>"One pair of boots, coming up." ACCEPT</STRING>
          </PROPERTY>
