                <STRING>"Welcome, $player$! You are just in time, we are about to begin!{break}Gather round, all of you, and watch the first act of the Story of Loria!{break}Loria was the only girl raised by a humble family of beachcombers.{break}All day long she would play and watch her cousins spinning the logs down at the river instead of doing chores for her aunty in the lodging.{break}Despite her aunt's scolding she always ended up down at the waterside.{break}Bright and breezy and free as the wind, was Loria, skipping after yubo and shooting the rapids better than any boy." SCENE_1</STRING>
              </PROPERTY>
            </CHILD>
            <CHILD TYPE="CPrimNode">
              <PROPERTY TYPE="string">
                <NAME>class</NAME>
                <STRING>ai_event</STRING>
              </PROPERTY>
              <PROPERTY TYPE="string">
                <NAME>group_name</NAME>
                <STRING>$actress$</STRING>
              </PROPERTY>
              <PROPERTY TYPE="string">
                <NAME>event_number</NAME>
                <STRING>0</STRING>
              </PROPERTY>
            </CHILD>
          </CHILD>
