              </PROPERTY>
              <PROPERTY TYPE="string_array">
                <NAME>phrase</NAME>
                <STRING>"The following morning, instead of going to the school house she ran along to the temple and amused the elders with stories of caverns and strange luminous plants.{break}The old sages laughed at her wild imagination but the following day she had a surprise for them." SCENE_3</STRING>
              </PROPERTY>
