                <STRING>"Loria was banned from going out for twenty days and the entrance was sealed with silt and clay.{break}Her confinement taught Loria a valuable lesson and she didn't go to that pothole again, nor did she say anything when she discovered another... but that's another tale!" SCENE_6</STRING>
